<view class="page-shell workspace-page"><text class="heading">通知模板配置</text><text class="muted">仅店长可保存。先在微信公众平台选用符合服务类目的订阅模板，再填写对应配置。</text><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text><view class="card"><button wx:for="{{scenes}}" wx:key="key" class="secondary" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="select">{{item.title}} · {{item.enabled ? '已启用' : '未启用'}}</button></view><view class="card"><text class="muted">选择已有场景，或填写新场景。新增业务仍须由后端产生对应通知事件。</text><input data-key="key" value="{{key}}" placeholder="场景标识，例如 lottery.result" bindinput="input"/><input data-key="title" value="{{title}}" placeholder="提醒名称" bindinput="input"/><textarea data-key="description" value="{{description}}" placeholder="向用户说明提醒用途" bindinput="input"/><input data-key="templateId" value="{{templateId}}" placeholder="微信订阅模板ID" bindinput="input"/><text class="muted">字段映射示例：{"thing1":"title","thing2":"result","time3":"time"}。字段名以微信模板为准；开奖结果提供 title、result、body、time。</text><textarea data-key="fields" value="{{fields}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/><view>启用提醒 <switch checked="{{enabled}}" bindchange="toggle"/></view><button bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存配置</button></view></view>
